#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:4
msgid "胞の形とブラベー格子型"
msgstr "Cell Shape and Bravais Lattice Type"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:6
msgid ""
"構造ファイルの胞が直交・六方・菱面体・体心正方の形に見えても、それだけでは\\ :ref:`ブラベー格子型<bravais-lattice-"
"types>`\\ は決まらない。 同じ格子点の集合を、形の違う胞で表せるからである。本稿では4つの例で、胞の形と格子型が食い違う場合を見て、 "
"胞の取り直しと、計量を変えて対称性を上げる格子の特殊化を区別する。最後に、例の格子点と計量を数値で確かめる。"
msgstr ""
"The cell in a structure file may look orthogonal, hexagonal, "
"rhombohedral, or body-centered tetragonal, but this alone does not "
"determine the \\ :ref:`Bravais lattice type <bravais-lattice-types>`\\ . "
"The same set of lattice points can be represented by cells of different "
"shapes. Four examples show how cell shape can suggest a different lattice"
" type. We distinguish a change of cell from specialization of the "
"lattice, in which a change in metric raises the symmetry. Finally, we "
"check the lattice points and metrics numerically."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:10
msgid ""
"**前提知識**: :ref:`格子の基底変換<lt-primitive-basis>`、:ref:`基本単位胞と慣用単位胞<lattice-"
"unit-cells>`、 :ref:`中心並進<centring-translation>`、:ref:`ブラベー格子型<bravais-"
"lattice-types>`、:ref:`計量行列<lattice-metric>`、 :ref:`FCCの慣用単位胞と基本単位胞<lt-"
"fcc-cell>`。"
msgstr ""
"**Prerequisites**: :ref:`Lattice basis transformations <lt-primitive-"
"basis>`, :ref:`primitive and conventional cells <lattice-unit-cells>`, "
":ref:`centering translations <centring-translation>`, :ref:`Bravais "
"lattice types <bravais-lattice-types>`, the :ref:`metric matrix <lattice-"
"metric>`, and the :ref:`conventional and primitive cells for FCC <lt-fcc-"
"cell>`."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:14
msgid "**学習目標**:"
msgstr "**Learning objectives**:"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:16
msgid "同じ格子点の集合を別の胞で表す「胞の取り直し」と、計量を変えて対称性を上げる「格子の特殊化」を区別する。"
msgstr ""
"Distinguish a change of cell, which represents the same set of lattice "
"points with a different cell, from specialization of the lattice, which "
"changes the metric and raises the symmetry."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:17
msgid "R格子の六方軸表示、六方P格子の直交C中心化胞、FCC格子の体心正方胞、菱面体形状の基本単位胞の例で、胞の形だけではブラベー格子型が決まらないことを説明する。"
msgstr ""
"Explain why cell shape alone does not determine Bravais lattice type "
"using the hexagonal setting of an R lattice, an orthogonal C-centered "
"cell for a hexagonal P lattice, a body-centered tetragonal cell for FCC, "
"and rhombohedrally shaped primitive cells."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:18
msgid "胞に含まれる格子点と計量を数値で求め、格子型を確かめる。"
msgstr ""
"Find the lattice points in the cell and calculate its metric numerically "
"to verify the lattice type."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:23
msgid "胞の取り直しと格子の特殊化"
msgstr "Change of Cell and Specialization of the Lattice"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:27
msgid ""
":ref:`基本単位胞や慣用単位胞<lattice-unit-cells>`\\ の辺の形と、中心並進を含む格子点集合のブラベー格子型は区別する。"
" 胞を取り直しても、中心の格子点や周期像を含めれば同じ並進格子を表す。格子点の集合が変わらないので、 "
"ブラベー格子型も変わらない。これに対し、辺長や角度を特殊な値へ\\ **変形**\\ すると、格子点の集合そのものが変わり、 "
"格子の対称性が高まってブラベー格子型が変わることがある。このように計量を変えて、より対称性の高い格子型へ移ることを **格子の特殊化** "
"と呼ぶ。格子型の間のこうした関係は `Grimmer (2015) "
"<https://doi.org/10.1107/S2053273314027351>`_ が整理している。"
msgstr ""
"Distinguish the shape defined by the edges of :ref:`a primitive cell or a"
" conventional cell <lattice-unit-cells>` \\ from the Bravais lattice type"
" of the set of lattice points, including centering translations. A change"
" of cell represents the same translation lattice when centering points "
"and periodic images are included. The set of lattice points is unchanged,"
" so the Bravais lattice type remains the same. By contrast, a \\ "
"**deformation** \\ that takes the edge lengths or angles to special "
"values changes the set of lattice points itself. The symmetry may "
"increase and the Bravais lattice type may change. This change of metric "
"to a more symmetric lattice type is called **specialization of the "
"lattice**. `Grimmer (2015) <https://doi.org/10.1107/S2053273314027351>`_ "
"describes these relationships between lattice types."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:33
msgid "以下の4つの例は、どれも胞の取り直しである。胞の形からは別の格子型に見えるが、格子点の集合とブラベー格子型は変わらない。"
msgstr ""
"All four examples below are changes of cell. The cell shape suggests a "
"different lattice type, but the set of lattice points and the Bravais "
"lattice type stay the same."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:38
msgid "R格子の菱面体基本単位胞と六方軸表示"
msgstr "R Lattice: Rhombohedral Primitive Cell and Hexagonal Setting"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:40
msgid ""
"三方晶系のR格子は、菱面体基本単位胞を使う表示と、R中心化された六方軸の胞を使う表示の両方がある。六方軸で書いても六方P格子になるわけではない。IUCr"
" International Tables for Crystallography, Volume A "
"はR格子の菱面体基本単位胞と体積が3倍のR中心化六方軸セルを区別し、ブラベー格子型を格子系ごとに定義している（`§1.3.2.4 "
"<https://it.iucr.org/Ac/ch1o3v0001/sec1o3o2o4.pdf>`_, `§1.3.4.4.3 "
"<https://it.iucr.org/Ac/ch1o3v0001/sec1o3o4o4o3.pdf>`_）。"
msgstr ""
"The R lattice of the trigonal crystal system can be described using "
"either a rhombohedral primitive cell or an R-centered cell in the "
"hexagonal setting. Using hexagonal axes does not make it a hexagonal P "
"lattice. The IUCr International Tables for Crystallography, Volume A, "
"distinguishes the rhombohedral primitive cell of an R lattice from the "
"R-centered hexagonal cell, which has three times the volume, and defines "
"the Bravais lattice types by lattice system (`§1.3.2.4 "
"<https://it.iucr.org/Ac/ch1o3v0001/sec1o3o2o4.pdf>`_, `§1.3.4.4.3 "
"<https://it.iucr.org/Ac/ch1o3v0001/sec1o3o4o4o3.pdf>`_)."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:42
msgid ""
"菱面体基本単位胞の列格子行列を :math:`A_R=(\\boldsymbol a_1,\\boldsymbol "
"a_2,\\boldsymbol a_3)` とし、各ベクトルの長さを :math:`a_R`、共通角を :math:`\\alpha_R` "
"とする。次の軸を選ぶ。"
msgstr ""
"Let :math:`A_R=(\\boldsymbol a_1,\\boldsymbol a_2,\\boldsymbol a_3)` be "
"the lattice matrix of the rhombohedral primitive cell with vectors as "
"columns, each of length :math:`a_R` and making a common angle "
":math:`\\alpha_R` with the others. Choose the axes"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:44
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\boldsymbol a_{R,H}&=\\boldsymbol a_1-\\boldsymbol a_2,\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol b_{R,H}&=\\boldsymbol a_2-\\boldsymbol a_3,\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol c_{R,H}&=\\boldsymbol a_1+\\boldsymbol a_2+\\boldsymbol a_3."
"\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\boldsymbol a_{R,H}&=\\boldsymbol a_1-\\boldsymbol a_2,\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol b_{R,H}&=\\boldsymbol a_2-\\boldsymbol a_3,\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol c_{R,H}&=\\boldsymbol a_1+\\boldsymbol a_2+\\boldsymbol a_3."
"\n"
"\\end{aligned}"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:52
#, python-brace-format
msgid "すると :math:`A_{R,H}=A_RP_{R,H}` で、"
msgstr "Then :math:`A_{R,H}=A_RP_{R,H}`, with"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:54
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"P_{R,H}=\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1&0&1\\\\-1&1&1\\\\0&-1&1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad \\det P_{R,H}=3."
msgstr ""
"P_{R,H}=\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1&0&1\\\\-1&1&1\\\\0&-1&1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad \\det P_{R,H}=3."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:60
msgid ":math:`q=\\cos\\alpha_R` とすれば、六方軸胞の格子定数と角度は"
msgstr ""
"With :math:`q=\\cos\\alpha_R`, the lattice constants and angles of the "
"cell in the hexagonal setting are"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:62
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"a_{R,H}=b_{R,H}=a_R\\sqrt{2(1-q)},\\qquad\n"
"c_{R,H}=a_R\\sqrt{3(1+2q)},"
msgstr ""
"a_{R,H}=b_{R,H}=a_R\\sqrt{2(1-q)},\\qquad\n"
"c_{R,H}=a_R\\sqrt{3(1+2q)},"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:67
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\alpha_{R,H}=\\beta_{R,H}=90^\\circ,\\qquad \\gamma_{R,H}=120^\\circ."
msgstr "\\alpha_{R,H}=\\beta_{R,H}=90^\\circ,\\qquad \\gamma_{R,H}=120^\\circ."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:71
msgid ""
"この胞の体積は菱面体基本単位胞の3倍で、分率座標 :math:`(0,0,0)` に加えて :math:`(2/3,1/3,1/3)` と "
":math:`(1/3,2/3,2/3)` にR中心並進による格子点を持つ。したがって、六方軸表示を六方P格子と読み替えると格子点を取り落とす。"
msgstr ""
"This cell has three times the volume of the rhombohedral primitive cell. "
"In addition to the point at fractional coordinates :math:`(0,0,0)`, it "
"has lattice points at :math:`(2/3,1/3,1/3)` and :math:`(1/3,2/3,2/3)` "
"from the R-centering translations. Interpreting the hexagonal setting as "
"a hexagonal P lattice would therefore omit lattice points."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:73
msgid ""
":numref:`fig-rhombohedral-hexagonal-layers`\\ では、六方軸胞を底面に平行な三つの "
"高さで切って、R中心並進による格子点の横方向のずれを示す。"
msgstr ""
":numref:`fig-rhombohedral-hexagonal-layers` \\ shows sections of the "
"hexagonal cell parallel to the basal plane at three heights, illustrating"
" the lateral offsets of the lattice points due to the R-centering "
"translations."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:76
msgid "R中心化六方軸胞の高さ0、1/3、2/3の三つの断面で、底面に平行な分率座標がそれぞれ(0,0)、(2/3,1/3)、(1/3,2/3)になる。"
msgstr ""
"At heights 0, 1/3, and 2/3 in the R-centered hexagonal cell, the "
"fractional coordinates parallel to the basal plane are (0,0), (2/3,1/3), "
"and (1/3,2/3), respectively."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:82
msgid ""
"各パネルの :math:`s_3` は六方軸胞での高さ。丸が格子点、下の座標が底面内の分率座標 :math:`(s_1,s_2)` "
"である。整数の並進で移る格子点は省略した。"
msgstr ""
"In each panel, :math:`s_3` is the height in the hexagonal cell. The "
"circle marks the lattice point, and the coordinates below it are its in-"
"plane fractional coordinates :math:`(s_1,s_2)`. Lattice points related by"
" integer translations are omitted."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:88
msgid "六方P格子を直交C中心化胞で表す"
msgstr "Representing a Hexagonal P Lattice with an Orthogonal C-Centered Cell"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:90
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"底面の長さが :math:`a`、角が :math:`120^\\circ` の六方P格子の基本並進ベクトルの組 :math:`A_{\\rm "
"hexP}` から、次の胞を作る。"
msgstr ""
"For a hexagonal P lattice with basal edge length :math:`a` and angle "
":math:`120^\\circ`, use the primitive translation vectors :math:`A_{\\rm "
"hexP}` to construct the following cell."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:92
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\boldsymbol a_o&=\\boldsymbol a_1+\\boldsymbol a_2,\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol b_o&=-\\boldsymbol a_1+\\boldsymbol a_2,\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol c_o&=\\boldsymbol a_3.\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\boldsymbol a_o&=\\boldsymbol a_1+\\boldsymbol a_2,\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol b_o&=-\\boldsymbol a_1+\\boldsymbol a_2,\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol c_o&=\\boldsymbol a_3.\n"
"\\end{aligned}"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:100
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A_o=A_{\\rm hexP}M_{\\rm hexP},\\qquad\n"
"M_{\\rm hexP}=\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1&-1&0\\\\1&1&0\\\\0&0&1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad \\det M_{\\rm hexP}=2."
msgstr ""
"A_o=A_{\\rm hexP}M_{\\rm hexP},\\qquad\n"
"M_{\\rm hexP}=\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1&-1&0\\\\1&1&0\\\\0&0&1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad \\det M_{\\rm hexP}=2."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:107
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"ここで :math:`A_{\\rm hexP}` は直前のR格子の六方軸セルとは異なり、六方P格子の\\ **基本単位胞**\\ "
"である。新しい辺は直交し、長さは :math:`a_o=a`、:math:`b_o=\\sqrt3a`、:math:`c_o=c`。旧格子ベクトル"
" :math:`\\boldsymbol a_2` は新胞の分率座標 :math:`(1/2,1/2,0)` "
"に来るため、この胞はC中心化している。胞の体積は2倍で、中心の格子点と周期像を含めれば六方Pと同じ格子点集合を表す。したがって、直交形状だけを根拠に直交P格子として扱ってはならない。"
msgstr ""
"Here :math:`A_{\\rm hexP}` is the \\ **primitive cell** \\ of the "
"hexagonal P lattice, unlike the preceding hexagonal cell of the R "
"lattice. The new edges are orthogonal, with lengths :math:`a_o=a`, "
":math:`b_o=\\sqrt3a`, and :math:`c_o=c`. The old lattice vector "
":math:`\\boldsymbol a_2` has fractional coordinates :math:`(1/2,1/2,0)` "
"in the new cell, so the cell is C-centered. Its volume is doubled. "
"Including the centering point and periodic images gives the same set of "
"lattice points as hexagonal P. The orthogonal shape alone is therefore "
"insufficient grounds for treating the lattice as an orthorhombic P "
"lattice."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:112
msgid "FCC格子を体心正方胞で表す"
msgstr "Representing the FCC Lattice with a Body-Centered Tetragonal Cell"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:114
msgid "一辺 :math:`a` のFCC慣用単位胞 :math:`A_c=aI` に対し、次の辺を選ぶ。"
msgstr ""
"For an FCC conventional cell of side length :math:`a` with "
":math:`A_c=aI`, choose the following edges."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:116
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\boldsymbol a_t&=\\tfrac a2(1,1,0),\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol b_t&=\\tfrac a2(-1,1,0),\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol c_t&=a(0,0,1).\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\boldsymbol a_t&=\\tfrac a2(1,1,0),\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol b_t&=\\tfrac a2(-1,1,0),\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol c_t&=a(0,0,1).\n"
"\\end{aligned}"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:124
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A_t=A_cP_{F,t},\\qquad\n"
"P_{F,t}=\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1/2&-1/2&0\\\\1/2&1/2&0\\\\0&0&1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad \\det P_{F,t}=1/2."
msgstr ""
"A_t=A_cP_{F,t},\\qquad\n"
"P_{F,t}=\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1/2&-1/2&0\\\\1/2&1/2&0\\\\0&0&1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad \\det P_{F,t}=1/2."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:131
msgid ""
"この胞は :math:`a_t=b_t=a/\\sqrt2`、:math:`c_t=a`、したがって "
":math:`c_t/a_t=\\sqrt2` の体心正方形状である。FCCの面心並進 :math:`\\tfrac a2(0,1,1)` "
"は新しい胞の分率座標 :math:`(1/2,1/2,1/2)_t` "
"に移る。体心点を含めれば、FCC慣用単位胞の半分の体積で同じFCC格子を表せる。この特殊な軸比ではブラベー格子型は立方Fである。"
msgstr ""
"This is a body-centered tetragonal cell with :math:`a_t=b_t=a/\\sqrt2`, "
":math:`c_t=a`, and hence :math:`c_t/a_t=\\sqrt2`. The FCC face-centering "
"translation :math:`\\tfrac a2(0,1,1)` goes to fractional coordinates "
":math:`(1/2,1/2,1/2)_t` in the new cell. Including the body center gives "
"the same FCC lattice in half the volume of the FCC conventional cell. At "
"this special axial ratio, the Bravais lattice type is cubic F."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:133
msgid ""
"一般の体心正方格子では :math:`c_t/a_t=1` が立方I（BCC）、:math:`c_t/a_t=\\sqrt2` "
"が立方F（FCC）に対応する。一般の体心正方格子をこれらの比へ\\ **変形**\\ "
"することは、単位胞の表現を変えることではなく、格子の特殊化である。"
msgstr ""
"For a general body-centered tetragonal lattice, :math:`c_t/a_t=1` "
"corresponds to cubic I (BCC) and :math:`c_t/a_t=\\sqrt2` to cubic F "
"(FCC). A \\ **deformation** \\ of a general body-centered tetragonal "
"lattice to either ratio is a specialization of the lattice rather than a "
"change in the choice of unit cell."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:138
msgid "菱面体形状の基本単位胞から立方格子を見分ける"
msgstr "Identifying Cubic Lattices from Rhombohedrally Shaped Primitive Cells"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:140
msgid "等長の3ベクトルが等しい相互角で張る菱面体形状は、三方晶R格子に限らない。角度が特別な値なら、より高い立方対称性を持つ基本単位胞にもなる。"
msgstr ""
"Three equal-length vectors with equal mutual angles span a rhombohedral "
"shape, which is not exclusive to a trigonal R lattice. At special angles "
"this shape can also be the primitive cell of a lattice with higher cubic "
"symmetry."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:142
msgid "菱面体形状の基本単位胞と対応する立方ブラベー格子"
msgstr ""
"Rhombohedrally shaped primitive cells and the corresponding cubic Bravais"
" lattices"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:147
msgid "基本並進ベクトル間の角度"
msgstr "Angle between primitive translation vectors"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:148
msgid "ブラベー格子型"
msgstr "Bravais lattice type"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:149
msgid ":math:`60^\\circ`"
msgstr ":math:`60^\\circ`"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:150
msgid "立方F（FCC）"
msgstr "Cubic F (FCC)"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:151
msgid ":math:`90^\\circ`"
msgstr ":math:`90^\\circ`"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:152
msgid "立方P（単純立方）"
msgstr "Cubic P (simple cubic)"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:153
msgid ":math:`\\arccos(-1/3)\\simeq109.47^\\circ`"
msgstr ":math:`\\arccos(-1/3)\\simeq109.47^\\circ`"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:154
msgid "立方I（BCC）"
msgstr "Cubic I (BCC)"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:156
msgid ""
"例えば\\ :ref:`FCCの基本並進ベクトル<lt-fcc-cell>`\\ は互いに :math:`60^\\circ` "
"で、菱面体形状を持つが、ブラベー格子型は三方Rではなく立方Fである。一般のR格子からこの角度条件へ計量を変える場合は、同一格子の基底変換ではなく格子の特殊化となる。"
msgstr ""
"For example, the \\ :ref:`FCC primitive translation vectors <lt-fcc-"
"cell>` \\ make an angle of :math:`60^\\circ` with each other and span a "
"rhombohedral shape, but the Bravais lattice type is cubic F, not trigonal"
" R. Changing the metric of a general R lattice to reach this angle is a "
"specialization of the lattice rather than a change of basis within the "
"same lattice."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:161
msgid "胞の形から格子型を判断するとき"
msgstr "Inferring the Lattice Type from the Cell Shape"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:163
msgid ""
"以上の例では、胞の形が直交・六方・菱面体・体心正方に見えることだけでブラベー格子型は決まらない。 "
"格子型を判断するときは、胞の辺と角度だけでなく、中心並進を含む格子点集合を調べる。 実際の構造では、格子還元や対称性探索（\\ "
":ref:`構造の標準化<lt-standardize-cell>`）で標準的な胞を求めてから格子型を読むとよい。 "
"また、胞の取り直しと、計量を変える格子の特殊化を区別する。前者では格子型は変わらず、後者では変わりうる。 "
"さらに、原子配置を含む結晶の空間群は格子型だけでは決まらない。"
msgstr ""
"As these examples show, an orthogonal, hexagonal, rhombohedral, or body-"
"centered tetragonal cell shape alone does not determine the Bravais "
"lattice type. To identify the type, examine the set of lattice points, "
"including centering translations, as well as the cell edges and angles. "
"For a real structure, use lattice reduction or symmetry searching (see \\"
" :ref:`structure standardization <lt-standardize-cell>`) to find a "
"standard cell and identify its lattice type. Also distinguish a change of"
" cell from specialization of the lattice through a change of metric. The "
"former preserves the lattice type, whereas the latter can change it. The "
"lattice type alone is also insufficient to determine the space group of "
"the crystal, which includes the atomic arrangement."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:172
msgid "数値での確認"
msgstr "Numerical Check"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:174
msgid ""
"次のNumPy例は、4つの例の格子点と計量を確かめる。``lattice_points`` は、整数行列 :math:`P` で作った胞の中に、 "
"元の格子の格子点が分率座標でどこに来るかを返す。:math:`P` の行列式の絶対値が胞に含まれる格子点の数になる。探す格子点の範囲は "
":math:`P` の各行の成分の絶対値の和で決めるので、掲載した例に限らず行列式が0でない整数行列なら使える。 格子ベクトルは\\ "
":ref:`基底変換<lt-primitive-basis>`\\ の式と同様に\\ **列**\\ で保持する。"
msgstr ""
"The following NumPy example checks the lattice points and metrics of the "
"four cases. ``lattice_points`` returns the fractional coordinates of the "
"original lattice points within a cell constructed with integer matrix "
":math:`P`. The absolute determinant of :math:`P` gives the number of "
"lattice points in the cell. The sum of the absolute values of the entries"
" in each row of :math:`P` bounds the search for lattice points. The "
"function therefore works for any integer matrix with nonzero determinant,"
" not only the examples shown here. As in the formulas for the \\ "
":ref:`basis transformation <lt-primitive-basis>`\\ , the lattice vectors "
"are stored as \\ **columns**\\ ."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:178
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"from itertools import product\n"
"import numpy as np\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"def lattice_points(P):\n"
"    \"\"\"整数行列 P で作った胞に入る、元の格子の格子点の分率座標。\n"
"\n"
"    胞の中の点 s（0 <= s_j < 1）は元の格子で n = P s に来るので、\n"
"    n_i の範囲は P の i 行の絶対値の和で抑えられる。\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"
"    Pinv = np.linalg.inv(P)\n"
"    bounds = np.abs(P).sum(axis=1).round().astype(int)\n"
"    points = {tuple(np.round((Pinv @ n) % 1.0, 6) % 1.0)\n"
"              for n in product(*(range(-b, b + 1) for b in bounds))}\n"
"    assert len(points) == round(abs(np.linalg.det(P)))\n"
"    return sorted(points)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"def cell_parameters(A):\n"
"    G = A.T @ A\n"
"    lengths = np.sqrt(np.diag(G))\n"
"    cosines = [G[1, 2] / (lengths[1] * lengths[2]),\n"
"               G[0, 2] / (lengths[0] * lengths[2]),\n"
"               G[0, 1] / (lengths[0] * lengths[1])]\n"
"    return lengths, np.degrees(np.arccos(cosines))\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"# R格子: 菱面体基本単位胞から六方軸の胞へ\n"
"aR, alpha = 5.0, np.radians(50.0)\n"
"q = np.cos(alpha)\n"
"x = np.sqrt((1 + 2 * q) / 3)          # 3本が[111]となす角の余弦\n"
"r = np.sqrt(1 - x**2)\n"
"AR = aR * np.array([[r * np.cos(phi), r * np.sin(phi), x]\n"
"                    for phi in (0, 2 * np.pi / 3, 4 * np.pi / 3)]).T\n"
"PRH = np.array([[1, 0, 1], [-1, 1, 1], [0, -1, 1]])\n"
"lengths, angles = cell_parameters(AR @ PRH)\n"
"assert np.isclose(round(np.linalg.det(PRH)), 3)\n"
"assert np.allclose(lengths, [aR * np.sqrt(2 * (1 - q))] * 2 + [aR * "
"np.sqrt(3 * (1 + 2 * q))])\n"
"assert np.allclose(angles, [90, 90, 120])\n"
"assert np.allclose(lattice_points(PRH), [(0, 0, 0), (1/3, 2/3, 2/3), "
"(2/3, 1/3, 1/3)])\n"
"\n"
"# 六方P格子: 直交C中心化胞\n"
"a, c = 3.0, 5.0\n"
"Ahex = np.array([[a, -a / 2, 0], [0, np.sqrt(3) * a / 2, 0], [0, 0, c]])\n"
"M = np.array([[1, -1, 0], [1, 1, 0], [0, 0, 1]])\n"
"lengths, angles = cell_parameters(Ahex @ M)\n"
"assert np.allclose(lengths, [a, np.sqrt(3) * a, c]) and "
"np.allclose(angles, 90)\n"
"assert np.allclose(lattice_points(M), [(0, 0, 0), (0.5, 0.5, 0)])\n"
"\n"
"# FCC格子: 体心正方胞（基本単位胞からの変換は整数行列）\n"
"PF = 0.5 * np.array([[0, 1, 1], [1, 0, 1], [1, 1, 0]])\n"
"PFt = np.array([[0.5, -0.5, 0], [0.5, 0.5, 0], [0, 0, 1]])\n"
"Q = np.linalg.solve(PF, PFt)\n"
"assert np.allclose(Q, np.round(Q))\n"
"lengths, angles = cell_parameters(4.0 * PFt)\n"
"assert np.isclose(lengths[2] / lengths[0], np.sqrt(2)) and "
"np.allclose(angles, 90)\n"
"assert np.allclose(lattice_points(np.round(Q)), [(0, 0, 0), (0.5, 0.5, "
"0.5)])\n"
"\n"
"# 菱面体形状の基本単位胞と立方格子\n"
"bcc = 0.5 * np.array([[-1, 1, 1], [1, -1, 1], [1, 1, -1]])\n"
"for P, expected in ((PF, 60.0), (np.eye(3), 90.0), (bcc, "
"np.degrees(np.arccos(-1 / 3)))):\n"
"    lengths, angles = cell_parameters(P)\n"
"    assert np.allclose(lengths, lengths[0]) and np.allclose(angles, "
"expected)"
msgstr ""
"from itertools import product\n"
"import numpy as np\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"def lattice_points(P):\n"
"    \"\"\"Fractional coordinates of original lattice points in the cell "
"constructed with integer matrix P.\n"
"\n"
"    A point s in the cell (0 <= s_j < 1) corresponds to n = P s in the "
"original lattice, so\n"
"    the sum of absolute values in row i of P bounds the range of n_i.\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"
"    Pinv = np.linalg.inv(P)\n"
"    bounds = np.abs(P).sum(axis=1).round().astype(int)\n"
"    points = {tuple(np.round((Pinv @ n) % 1.0, 6) % 1.0)\n"
"              for n in product(*(range(-b, b + 1) for b in bounds))}\n"
"    assert len(points) == round(abs(np.linalg.det(P)))\n"
"    return sorted(points)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"def cell_parameters(A):\n"
"    G = A.T @ A\n"
"    lengths = np.sqrt(np.diag(G))\n"
"    cosines = [G[1, 2] / (lengths[1] * lengths[2]),\n"
"               G[0, 2] / (lengths[0] * lengths[2]),\n"
"               G[0, 1] / (lengths[0] * lengths[1])]\n"
"    return lengths, np.degrees(np.arccos(cosines))\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"# R lattice: from the rhombohedral primitive cell to the hexagonal "
"setting\n"
"aR, alpha = 5.0, np.radians(50.0)\n"
"q = np.cos(alpha)\n"
"x = np.sqrt((1 + 2 * q) / 3)          # Cosine of the angle each of the "
"three vectors makes with [111]\n"
"r = np.sqrt(1 - x**2)\n"
"AR = aR * np.array([[r * np.cos(phi), r * np.sin(phi), x]\n"
"                    for phi in (0, 2 * np.pi / 3, 4 * np.pi / 3)]).T\n"
"PRH = np.array([[1, 0, 1], [-1, 1, 1], [0, -1, 1]])\n"
"lengths, angles = cell_parameters(AR @ PRH)\n"
"assert np.isclose(round(np.linalg.det(PRH)), 3)\n"
"assert np.allclose(lengths, [aR * np.sqrt(2 * (1 - q))] * 2 + [aR * "
"np.sqrt(3 * (1 + 2 * q))])\n"
"assert np.allclose(angles, [90, 90, 120])\n"
"assert np.allclose(lattice_points(PRH), [(0, 0, 0), (1/3, 2/3, 2/3), "
"(2/3, 1/3, 1/3)])\n"
"\n"
"# Hexagonal P lattice: orthogonal C-centered cell\n"
"a, c = 3.0, 5.0\n"
"Ahex = np.array([[a, -a / 2, 0], [0, np.sqrt(3) * a / 2, 0], [0, 0, c]])\n"
"M = np.array([[1, -1, 0], [1, 1, 0], [0, 0, 1]])\n"
"lengths, angles = cell_parameters(Ahex @ M)\n"
"assert np.allclose(lengths, [a, np.sqrt(3) * a, c]) and "
"np.allclose(angles, 90)\n"
"assert np.allclose(lattice_points(M), [(0, 0, 0), (0.5, 0.5, 0)])\n"
"\n"
"# FCC lattice: body-centered tetragonal cell (integer transformation "
"matrix from the primitive cell)\n"
"PF = 0.5 * np.array([[0, 1, 1], [1, 0, 1], [1, 1, 0]])\n"
"PFt = np.array([[0.5, -0.5, 0], [0.5, 0.5, 0], [0, 0, 1]])\n"
"Q = np.linalg.solve(PF, PFt)\n"
"assert np.allclose(Q, np.round(Q))\n"
"lengths, angles = cell_parameters(4.0 * PFt)\n"
"assert np.isclose(lengths[2] / lengths[0], np.sqrt(2)) and "
"np.allclose(angles, 90)\n"
"assert np.allclose(lattice_points(np.round(Q)), [(0, 0, 0), (0.5, 0.5, "
"0.5)])\n"
"\n"
"# Rhombohedrally shaped primitive cells and cubic lattices\n"
"bcc = 0.5 * np.array([[-1, 1, 1], [1, -1, 1], [1, 1, -1]])\n"
"for P, expected in ((PF, 60.0), (np.eye(3), 90.0), (bcc, "
"np.degrees(np.arccos(-1 / 3)))):\n"
"    lengths, angles = cell_parameters(P)\n"
"    assert np.allclose(lengths, lengths[0]) and np.allclose(angles, "
"expected)"

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:244
msgid ""
"R格子の六方軸の胞には、原点と :math:`(2/3,1/3,1/3)`、:math:`(1/3,2/3,2/3)` "
"の3つの格子点が入り、角度は :math:`90^\\circ`、:math:`90^\\circ`、:math:`120^\\circ` "
"になる。 六方P格子の直交胞には原点と :math:`(1/2,1/2,0)` の2つ、FCC格子の体心正方胞には原点と "
":math:`(1/2,1/2,1/2)` の2つが入る。 "
"FCC格子の体心正方胞は、FCCの基本単位胞から整数行列で作れるので、格子の特殊化ではなく胞の取り直しである。 基本並進ベクトルの角度が "
":math:`60^\\circ`、:math:`90^\\circ`、:math:`109.47^\\circ` "
"の菱面体形状の胞は、それぞれFCC、単純立方、BCCの基本単位胞と同じ計量を持つ。"
msgstr ""
"The R-centered hexagonal cell contains three lattice points, at the "
"origin, :math:`(2/3,1/3,1/3)`, and :math:`(1/3,2/3,2/3)`, and its angles "
"are :math:`90^\\circ`, :math:`90^\\circ`, and :math:`120^\\circ`. The "
"orthogonal cell of the hexagonal P lattice contains two points, at the "
"origin and :math:`(1/2,1/2,0)`. The FCC body-centered tetragonal cell "
"also contains two points, at the origin and :math:`(1/2,1/2,1/2)`. The "
"latter cell can be constructed from the FCC primitive cell using an "
"integer matrix, so this is a change of cell and not a specialization of "
"the lattice. Rhombohedrally shaped cells in which the primitive "
"translation vectors make angles of :math:`60^\\circ`, :math:`90^\\circ`, "
"and :math:`109.47^\\circ` have the same metrics as the primitive cells of"
" FCC, simple cubic, and BCC lattices, respectively."

#: ../../solid/cell_shape_bravais.rst:249
